  "RoleInfo.Detective": "Gather Info, Solve Murders",
  "RoleInfo.Viper": "Kill to Dissolve Bodies",
  "RoleInfo.Judge": "Silence in the courtroom!",
  "RoleInfo.CrewmateGhost": "Tasks are not finished...",
  "RoleInfo.ImpostorGhost": "The game is not over...",
  "RoleInfoLong.Crewmate": "(Crewmates):\nAs the Crewmate, your goal is simple: finish all your tasks, or vote out every Impostor.",
  "RoleInfoLong.Impostor": "(Impostors):\nAs the Impostor, your goal is to kill off the crewmates simply. You can sabotage and vent.",
  "RoleInfoLong.Engineer": "(Crewmates):\nAs the Engineer, you may access the vents while comms are not sabotaged. Vents are disabled when they are sabotaged.",
  "RoleInfoLong.Scientist": "(Crewmates):\nAs the Scientist, you carry a portable vitals tablet you can check from anywhere - but its battery is limited.",
  "RoleInfoLong.GuardianAngel": "(Crewmates):\nAs the Guardian Angel, after you die you become a guardian spirit and can shield a living crewmate, blocking one kill.",
  "RoleInfoLong.Shapeshifter": "(Impostors):\nAs the Shapeshifter, you have a shapeshifting ability that you may use to frame other crewmates. Just be aware that there is an egg while shifting, and the disguise is temporary.",
  "RoleInfoLong.Noisemaker": "(Crewmates):\nAs the Noisemaker, when you die, all crewmates will get alerted, and an arrow pointing to your body will appear.",
  "RoleInfoLong.Phantom": "(Impostors):\nAs the Phantom, you can go invisible for a short period. During this time, you can't be seen by Crewmates.",
  "RoleInfoLong.Tracker": "(Crewmates):\nAs the Tracker, you can track players by placing a tracker on them using your track button.",
  "RoleInfoLong.Detective": "(Crewmates):\nAs the Detective, you can write down notes about each crime scene and interrogate suspects.",
  "RoleInfoLong.Viper": "(Impostors):\nAs the Viper, the bodies you leave behind slowly dissolve due to your acid, causing them to disappear and become unreportable.",
  "RoleInfoLong.Judge": "(Crewmates):\nOverrule a meeting to eject a player directly.\nIf you eject a Crewmate, you are ejected instead.",
  "RoleInfoLong.CrewmateGhost": "(Crewmate Ghost):\nYou are dead. You can still finish your tasks and pass through walls to watch the game.",
  "RoleInfoLong.ImpostorGhost": "(Impostor Ghost):\nYou are dead. You can pass through walls to watch the game, but you can no longer kill.",
  "SpiritGuide": "Influencer",
  "RoleInfo.SpiritGuide": "Still on camera after death!",
  "RoleInfoLong.SpiritGuide": "(Crewmate Ghost):\nAs the Influencer, you keep working after death: use your camera to take photos, then send them along with messages to living Crewmates to help narrow down the suspects.\nNote: every send has a cooldown, so do not spam it.",
